# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Required APIs to enable on Google Cloud Console:
# 1. Routes API (directions/v2:computeRoutes & distanceMatrix/v2:computeRouteMatrix)
# 2. Places API (New) (places:searchText, place details)
# 3. Maps JavaScript API (for interactive web rendering)
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
